OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrisk southwest winds. Rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with best of limited brighter
OL,7,Fspells expected in the east and during
OL,8,Fthe early to mid-morning. Some patchy
OL,9,Frain about, this focused west of Lough
OL,10,FNeagh.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWindy and cloudy. Rain
OL,13,Fextending from the west across the
OL,14,Fwhole country during the evening,
OL,15,Fperhaps turning heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
