OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloud and rain initially,
OL,6,Fclearing to a mix of scattered light
OL,7,Fshowers and brighter spells during the
OL,8,Fmorning. Showers building in west late
OL,9,Fafternoon and turning wintry across
OL,10,Fthe hills.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FShowers and sunshine for Monday. Rain
OL,14,Fand hill snow for Tuesday. Largely dry
OL,15,Fwith plentiful periods of weak winter
OL,16,Fsunshine on Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,17,Fseasonally low given the generally
OL,18,Fnortherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
